      "desc": "Attacks no longer recover <color=#FFFFFF>Corrosive Chill</color>. Instead <color=#2BAD00>recover an additional</color> <color=#2BAD00>5/s</color> <color=#FFFFFF>Corrosive Chill</color> . With <color=#FFFFFF>Trial by Cold</color>, <color=#2BAD00>switching on-field replaces the normal switch-in</color> with <color=#FFFFFF>Special Attack: Execution - Layered Frost</color>, this effect can trigger once every 10s. When <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Execution - Merciless Judgment</color> hits an enemy, the enemy's <color=#2BAD00>Ice RES is reduced by 24</color> for 20s, repeated triggers reset the duration.",
